### Register User
POST http://localhost:3000/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Aaditya",
    "email": "aadi@gmail.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Login User
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "aadi@gmail.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Access Protected Profile
GET http://localhost:3000/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN